00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:05.680
Your weapons aren't gonna do it,
just like I figured.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:07.570
Well, leave it to someone who knows what he's doing.

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:09.370
Stand aside and let me handle this.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:10.000
I'm going in!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.300
Hold it...
I'm going in!

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:11.390
I'm going in!

