Who wants some bounty hunter like you to do a half-assed job?

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:21.880
Now, now, Madoka, what's this?!

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:23.210
In the old days, we used to...

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:25.510
