Madoka! You're crazy!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:42.230
Let's go for it!

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:48.240
Kyosuke, in the old days you were a klutz, but...

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:51.320
...your heart was in everything you did...
I loved that about you.

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:54.230
But... now that you have everything...

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.280
Madoka!

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.510
Yuusaku! Now!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.910
Right!
Yuusaku! Now!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:10.990
