00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:19.320
Ayukawa!

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:24.280
Oh! Shot down! A plane's been shot down!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:26.820
The leader of TAP GUN,
the squad that creamed Yojira and Redon...

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:30.170
