00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:37.110
Will Japan be overcome by this giant feline monster?!

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:38.380
Jingoro...

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:41.300
Jingoro... Do you want to... that badly...?

00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:42.220
Kurumi!

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:43.090
Manami!
Kurumi!

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:45.560
Uh-huh! Uh-huh!

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.870
Ayukawa...

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:57.600
All I wanted was...
to be the one man you got along with!

00:20:06.380 --> 00:20:09.350
