00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:38.100
He's done it at last...

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:41.970
Captain Ayukawa... Black Fighter... Such irreplaceable sacrifices...

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:43.800
Captain Ayukawa...

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.240
On the other hand,
Hikaru can be mine now!

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.470
How the hell do you know Hikaru?!

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.840
