00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:51.670
Sorry...

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:54.550
Jingoro... Jingoro...

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:55.100
Huh?!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.060
Wh... What the heck is that?!
Huh?!

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:56.150
Huh?!

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.330
I got a bad feeling about this!

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:58.230
Doungan Kasakuyan Indoumu...
I got a bad feeling about this!

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:02.670
Doungan Kasakuyan Indoumu...

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:08.660
Rusuto Uiraadoa Hanba Hanbaamuyan.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:12.350
Randa Banun Radan Tounjukanraa.

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.750
Aaargh!
Randa Banun Radan Tounjukanraa.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:13.840
Randa Banun Radan Tounjukanraa.

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:13.920
Kasaku Yaanmu.

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:16.710
Well, I did have a feeling that it'd come to this.
Kasaku Yaanmu.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:16.800
Kasaku Yaanmu.

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:16.890
Jingoro... Jingoro...

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:18.320
And Jingoro came back to life, so...
Jingoro... Jingoro...

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:18.450
Jingoro... Jingoro...

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:22.580
"Witness A Miracle, in The Voices That Sing!"
How's that for a headline?
Jingoro... Jingoro...

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:22.670
Jingoro... Jingoro...

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:25.470
I get it! Jingoro came to bring home
the island princesses...

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:28.270
...who had run away to the big city...

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:31.220
...because he's the island's guardian, right?

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:33.290
