00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:55.880
Ha! I've always wanted to say that line!

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:08.570
So, you're leavin'?

00:22:08.570 --> 00:22:10.270
Yeah.
So, you're leavin'?

00:22:10.270 --> 00:22:10.360
So, you're leavin'?

